the ArrayExpress website and manually download the different MAGE-ML 
files that are needed, it only works for spotted arrays, and the MAGE-ML 
format is currently being replaced by a quite different format MAGE-TAB, 
for which the RMAGEML package can not be used anymore.

Cheers,
Steffen

